Here are the HTML templates for **Supply Chain Management** and **Reports** pages. Each page will follow a similar structure to ensure consistency across the website.

### **1. Supply Chain Management (supply_chain.html)**

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Supply Chain Management</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        .sidebar {
            width: 250px;
            background-color: #333;
            color: white;
            position: fixed;
            height: 100%;
            padding-top: 20px;
